    "excerpt": "",
    "content_html": "<img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-658\" src=\"https://cfi.co/awards/wp-content/uploads/2013/07/dateline-LOGO.jpg\" alt=\"dateline LOGO\" width=\"480\" height=\"232\" />\r\n\r\n<strong>The CFI judging panel congratulates Dateline Energy Services on its recent restructuring and the creation of new platforms to ensure competitiveness in a tough market place.</strong> Dateline has a good record of working for a major international player having created a scope of work that is resulting in significant new business. This company is well placed to achieve significantly improved results for its stakeholders. Dateline wins our award for ‘Best Oil &amp; Gas Project Support Services, Nigeria, 2013.’",
